title: "[Activity] NotThrowPattern.Rewrite - Fixed of Manual" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
vars: {
  d2-legend: {
    f: Fixed {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"}
    m: Manual {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"}
  }
}
start: "" {shape: circle; width: 20; style: {fill: black; stroke: "#9ca3af"}}
q1: "Niet NotThrowAfter?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: NotThrowAfter waits and polls\n(proof: after)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q2: "Niet generiek NotThrow<T>()?" {shape: diamond}
m2: "Manual: NotThrow<T>() only forbids exception type T\n(proof: generic)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q3: "Vorm x.Should().NotThrow()?" {shape: diamond}
m3: "Manual: NotThrow() is not in the form x.Should().NotThrow()\n(geen proof)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q4: "Resultaat weggegooid?" {shape: diamond}
m4: "Manual: The result of NotThrow() is used\n(proof: result-used, value-used)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q5: "Subject niet gebouwd met Invoking(...)?" {shape: diamond}
m5: "Manual: The subject is built with Invoking(...)\n(proof: invoking)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q6: "Subject is een parameterloze Action of Func?" {shape: diamond}
m6: "Manual: The subject is not a parameterless Action or Func\n(geen proof)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q7: "Geen becauseArgs, geen waarde-argumenten?" {shape: diamond}
m7: "Manual: becauseArgs of benoemde argumenten\n(proof: because-args)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
s: "Is er een because?" {shape: diamond}
f1: "Fixed: Should.NotThrow(act)\n(proof: simple, func, value-func)" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
f2: "Fixed: Should.NotThrow(act, because)\n(proof: because)" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
start -> q1
q1 -> m1: nee
q1 -> q2: ja
q2 -> m2: nee
q2 -> q3: ja
q3 -> m3: nee
q3 -> q4: ja
q4 -> m4: nee
q4 -> q5: ja
q5 -> m5: nee
q5 -> q6: ja
q6 -> m6: nee
q6 -> q7: ja
q7 -> m7: nee
q7 -> s: ja
s -> f1: "nee"
s -> f2: "ja"
